OL,3,AGovernment investigating 'serious cyber
OL,4,Aincident' hitting pension and benefits
OL,5,Aservices, minister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FWork and Pensions Secretary Pat
OL,8,FMcFadden says investigations are
OL,9,Fongoing into a "serious cyber incident"
OL,10,Faffecting his government department
OL,12,FThere's currently no suggestion
OL,13,Fpersonal data has been lost, the prime
OL,14,Fminister's official spokesperson has
OL,15,Fsaid, adding "malicious" activity
OL,16,Fhasn't been ruled out - read more
OL,18,FThe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,19,Ftook pension, universal credit and Pip
OL,20,Fservices offline earlier, in what it
OL,21,Fsaid was a precaution
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
